{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图文对齐与生成式 VLM：开放语义不等于视觉事实</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Vision-Language Models</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_031_blip_2-title\">BLIP-2</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">Q-Former 的 learnable queries 作为冻结图像 encoder 与冻结 LLM 之间唯一可训练的视觉信息瓶颈。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Bridges a frozen pretrained image encoder to a frozen LLM using a lightweight Querying Transformer (Q-Former) with learnable query tokens as an information bottleneck.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">图像与文本配对，生成阶段输入图像和文本 prompt</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Image + text caption (Stage 1) or image + natural-language instruction prompt (Stage 2)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">图像条件文本或视觉语言表征</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Fixed-length visual query embeddings and autoregressive image-conditioned text generation</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.1</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://proceedings.mlr.press/v202/li23q.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_031_blip_2')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_031_blip_2')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"BLIP-2 original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/2fa465929474eab89acc.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.1</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_031_blip_2', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_031_blip_2\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_031_blip_2')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_031_blip_2', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_031_blip_2\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">图像由已预训练且冻结的视觉主干读取。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests image + text caption (stage 1) or image + natural-language instruction prompt (stage 2) and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"图像由已预训练且冻结的视觉主干读取。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests image + text caption (stage 1) or image + natural-language instruction prompt (stage 2) and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"输入图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Input Image\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_031_blip_2', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">输入图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Input Image</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">图像由已预训练且冻结的视觉主干读取。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests image + text caption (stage 1) or image + natural-language instruction prompt (stage 2) and prepares initial tensor representations (Input Image).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"高容量 ViT 产生空间视觉 tokens，BLIP-2 训练时不更新。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Frozen Image Encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"冻结 Image Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Frozen Image Encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_031_blip_2', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">冻结 Image Encoder</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Frozen Image Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">高容量 ViT 产生空间视觉 tokens，BLIP-2 训练时不更新。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Frozen Image Encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"固定数量 query token 是视觉信息进入语言侧的可训练瓶颈。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Learnable Query Tokens within the core frozen vision qformer frozen llm bridge computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"可学习 Queries\" data-node-name-en=\"Learnable Query Tokens\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_031_blip_2', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">可学习 Queries</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Learnable Query Tokens</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">固定数量 query token 是视觉信息进入语言侧的可训练瓶颈。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Learnable Query Tokens within the core frozen vision qformer frozen llm bridge computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"共享 self-attention 的两个 Transformer 子模块中，query 以周期性交叉注意力读取冻结视觉 tokens。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Q-Former within the core frozen vision qformer frozen llm bridge computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Q-Former\" data-node-name-en=\"Q-Former\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_031_blip_2', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Q-Former</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">共享 self-attention 的两个 Transformer 子模块中，query 以周期性交叉注意力读取冻结视觉 tokens。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Q-Former within the core frozen vision qformer frozen llm bridge computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"图文对比、图文匹配与图像条件文本生成共同训练 query–vision 对齐。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs representation objective within the core frozen vision qformer frozen llm bridge computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"表征学习三目标\" data-node-name-en=\"representation objective\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_031_blip_2', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">表征学习三目标</span><span class=\"lang-en\">representation objective</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">图文对比、图文匹配与图像条件文本生成共同训练 query–vision 对齐。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs representation objective within the core frozen vision qformer frozen llm bridge computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"Q-Former 输出线性映射到目标 LLM 的 token embedding 维度。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs LLM projection within the core frozen vision qformer frozen llm bridge computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"LLM 投影\" data-node-name-en=\"LLM projection\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_031_blip_2', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">LLM 投影</span><span class=\"lang-en\">LLM projection</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">Q-Former 输出线性映射到目标 LLM 的 token embedding 维度。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs LLM projection within the core frozen vision qformer frozen llm bridge computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"任务指令或问题与视觉前缀共同构成 LLM 上下文。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Text Prompt within the core frozen vision qformer frozen llm bridge computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"文本 Prompt\" data-node-name-en=\"Text Prompt\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_031_blip_2', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">文本 Prompt</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Text Prompt</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">任务指令或问题与视觉前缀共同构成 LLM 上下文。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Text Prompt within the core frozen vision qformer frozen llm bridge computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"OPT 或 FlanT5 等语言模型保持冻结，仅由视觉前缀条件化。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Frozen LLM to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"冻结 LLM\" data-node-name-en=\"Frozen LLM\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_031_blip_2', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">冻结 LLM</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Frozen LLM</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">OPT 或 FlanT5 等语言模型保持冻结，仅由视觉前缀条件化。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Frozen LLM to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"LLM 自回归/序列到序列地产生描述、答案或其他文本。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces fixed-length visual query embeddings and autoregressive image-conditioned text generation via Stage 09.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"条件生成\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 09\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_031_blip_2', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">条件生成</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 09</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">LLM 自回归/序列到序列地产生描述、答案或其他文本。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces fixed-length visual query embeddings and autoregressive image-conditioned text generation via Stage 09.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"BLIP-2 Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · Q-Former queries 压缩视觉 token 后投影给 LLM</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Learnable Q-Former Queries Extracting Text-Relevant Visual Tokens for a Frozen LLM</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"BLIP-2：核心公式 · Q-Former queries 压缩视觉 token 后投影给 LLM\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"31\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"24.843903pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.525241 -69.083544 244.573692 24.843903\" width=\"244.573692pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M5.057401 0L5.050155-.115929C4.53572-.159402 4.492247-.181139 4.253143-.52168L2.760558-2.717085L5.144347-4.354581C5.383451-4.506738 5.550099-4.586439 5.738483-4.615421V-4.73135H3.985058V-4.615421L4.20967-4.593685C4.412546-4.579194 4.492247-4.53572 4.492247-4.456019C4.499492-4.282126 4.180688-4.006794 3.347448-3.485114L2.108458-2.709839L2.485227-4.07925C2.59391-4.441528 2.818523-4.586439 3.303975-4.615421V-4.73135H1.007133V-4.615421C1.528813-4.571948 1.651988-4.513984 1.659233-4.303862C1.659233-4.195179 1.651988-4.050268 1.586778-3.854638L.71731-.6521C.58689-.217367 .528926-.181139 .043473-.115929L.050719 0H2.130194L2.122949-.115929C1.601269-.166648 1.528813-.210121 1.521567-.434734C1.521567-.514435 1.521567-.565154 1.572286-.71731L1.61576-.869467L2.064984-2.521455L3.115591-1.014378C3.332957-.71731 3.448886-.463716 3.448886-.32605C3.456132-.217367 3.340203-.159402 3.064872-.137666L2.811277-.115929L2.818523 0H5.057401Z\" id=\"m031_g13-32\"></path><path d=\"M4.832788-3.651762C4.811051-4.347336 4.173442-4.73135 3.057626-4.73135H1.021624V-4.615421C1.492585-4.564702 1.61576-4.506738 1.623005-4.311108C1.623005-4.202424 1.601269-4.072004 1.499831-3.7